sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Agent loop
    participant M as CapabilityRoutingMiddleware
    participant L as Chat model
    participant R as MCPRuntime
    participant S as MCP server

    A->>M: before each model call
    M->>R: query(latest user message, type=TOOL, limit)
    R->>R: rank the registry, without calling any server
    opt nothing matches
        R->>S: refresh the servers that allow it
        S-->>R: tools, resources, and prompts
        R->>R: rank again
    end
    R-->>M: the best matching tools
    M->>L: request with the routed tools added
    L-->>A: AI message with a tool call
    A->>M: run the tool call
    M->>R: execute(capability ID, arguments)
    R->>S: call the tool through the resilience pipeline
    S-->>R: result or error
    R-->>M: ToolMessage
    M-->>A: ToolMessage, or an error message the model can act on
